{"id":"1dad6688ca1582beca1ff7f740c86f406a621fb1","url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/002/639.htm","title":"OPPO Find X10 Pro Max 手机首批搭载天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"IT之家 (ITHome)","byline":"作者：汪淼","excerpt":"在今日的 2026 联发科天玑旗舰新品发布会上，OPPO 副总裁吴恒刚宣布，OPPO Find X10 Pro Max 手机首批搭载天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"paragraph\">\r\n            \r\n            <p data-vmark=\"9602\"><a href=\"https://www.ithome.com/\" target=\"_blank\">IT之家</a> 9 月 15 日消息，在今日的 2026 联发科天玑旗舰新品发布会上，OPPO 副总裁吴恒刚宣布，<strong>OPPO Find X10 Pro Max 手机首批搭载天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片</strong>。</p><p data-vmark=\"cc97\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/5864f604-4c08-4408-98ec-adb49703c1e9.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-vmark=\"db36\" data-mpos=\"2,2\" title=\"OPPO Find X10 Pro Max 手机首批搭载天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片\" srcset=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/5864f604-4c08-4408-98ec-adb49703c1e9.jpg 2x\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/5864f604-4c08-4408-98ec-adb49703c1e9.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" width=\"1440\" height=\"615\"></p><p data-vmark=\"6ee8\">OPPO Find X10 Pro Max 搭载 8000mAh 冰川电池，以及新一代潮汐引擎、ColorOS 17，宣称能够带来 <strong>8 小时 144Hz 游戏持久满帧体验</strong>，满帧时长比上一代提升 60%；还支持 6 小时 4K 60fps 视频持久录制。</p><p data-vmark=\"bc98\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/918fc02a-daa4-49e8-89bb-9a160a4cfa4d.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-vmark=\"e9d6\" data-mpos=\"0,2\" title=\"OPPO Find X10 Pro Max 手机首批搭载天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片\" srcset=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/918fc02a-daa4-49e8-89bb-9a160a4cfa4d.jpg 2x\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/918fc02a-daa4-49e8-89bb-9a160a4cfa4d.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" width=\"1440\" height=\"615\"></p><p data-vmark=\"d180\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/38698a72-e742-49fb-a908-cce0b66cfc4b.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-vmark=\"f682\" data-mpos=\"0,2\" title=\"OPPO Find X10 Pro Max 手机首批搭载天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片\" srcset=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/38698a72-e742-49fb-a908-cce0b66cfc4b.jpg 2x\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/38698a72-e742-49fb-a908-cce0b66cfc4b.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" width=\"1440\" height=\"615\"></p><p data-vmark=\"a68f\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/8a294578-81de-46be-aad5-23638acb78f0.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-vmark=\"d012\" data-mpos=\"0,2\" title=\"OPPO Find X10 Pro Max 手机首批搭载天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片\" srcset=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/8a294578-81de-46be-aad5-23638acb78f0.jpg 2x\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/8a294578-81de-46be-aad5-23638acb78f0.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" width=\"1440\" height=\"615\"></p><p data-vmark=\"70f4\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/22973bf0-05ff-46dc-a2ad-5525e1c9943a.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-vmark=\"e32c\" data-mpos=\"0,2\" title=\"OPPO Find X10 Pro Max 手机首批搭载天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片\" srcset=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/22973bf0-05ff-46dc-a2ad-5525e1c9943a.jpg 2x\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/22973bf0-05ff-46dc-a2ad-5525e1c9943a.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" width=\"1440\" height=\"615\"></p><p data-vmark=\"0f93\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/2d545ce5-ffe5-4d94-90b2-e6a83a29757e.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-vmark=\"780c\" data-mpos=\"0,2\" title=\"OPPO Find X10 Pro Max 手机首批搭载天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片\" srcset=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/2d545ce5-ffe5-4d94-90b2-e6a83a29757e.jpg 2x\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/2d545ce5-ffe5-4d94-90b2-e6a83a29757e.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" width=\"1440\" height=\"615\"></p><p data-vmark=\"ae00\">IT之家从发布会获悉，搭配天玑 9600 Pro 芯片，OPPO Find X10 Pro Max 的全新小布 AI 助手也迎来升级，比如主动规划、主动伴随、主动提醒等。</p><p data-vmark=\"9f8e\"><img sr